  "about": {
    "headline": "We are the heartbeat of campus culture.",
    "intro": "The purpose of the newly formed Cultural and Creative Society at the National Institute of Technology (NIT) Sikkim is to serve as a central forum that promotes & preserves all cultural, creative, and technical student activities.",
    "fullIntro": [
      "The purpose of the newly formed Cultural and Creative Society at the National Institute of Technology (NIT) Sikkim is to serve as a central forum that promotes & preserves all cultural, creative, and technical student activities.",
      "This society functions as an umbrella society for all existing student clubs and it's responsible for managing and coordinating a wide range of tasks. These responsibilities include planning the annual cultural calendar, reserving institute venues, managing publicity, and ensuring smooth coordination among the various clubs.",
      "This structure is designed to provide a unified framework for all student-led activities, ensuring they are well-planned and executed efficiently. This structure ensures that all institute as well as external level activities, including fests, are coordinated and maintained by this society."
    ],
    "mission": "To serve as a central forum that promotes, preserves, and celebrates all cultural, creative, and technical student-led activities at the institute and external levels.",
    "vision": "To build a unified and approachable platform that serves as the heart of student life at NIT Sikkim, by acting as a bridge between students, faculty, and administration, where ideas thrive, talents are celebrated, and challenges evolve into opportunities for growth.",
